        "title": "fix(feishu): retry once on token-invalid errors 99991663/99991664 with cache invalidation (fixes #97287)",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #97287.\n\nWhen the cached `tenant_access_token` becomes invalid (e.g. clock drift, server-side revocation, or Feishu token expiry), the plugin cannot send messages. Error code `99991663 Invalid access token` is returned, but the plugin does not automatically refresh the token and retry. Users must manually restart the gateway to recover.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n- `extensions/feishu/src/comment-shared.ts`: Added `addFeishuTokenCacheClearer` / `clearFeishuTokenCaches`. `getFeishuTokenInvalidCode` detects 99991663/99991664. `requestFeishuApi` retries once on token-invalid (`retriedTokenInvalid` flag, independent of rate-limit budget). Fulfilled token-invalid bodies handled.\n- `extensions/feishu/src/client.ts`: `createFeishuClient` creates a plugin-owned `Lark.Cache` via `buildSdkTokenCache()`. `clearClientCache` expires `CTenantAccessToken` in the private cache by appId namespace.\n- `extensions/feishu/src/send.ts`: getter pattern — `opts.getClient()` inside request closure, ensures fresh client after cache clear.\n- `extensions/feishu/src/streaming-card.ts`: `clearFeishuTokenCache` registered. CardKit create retry on 99991663/99991664.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Live runtime proof (2026-07-02T09:06:32+00:00, host: LIN-66D8BD4EA2C, commit: ebaaf9d2a9)\n\n```\n================================================================\n FEISHU TOKEN-INVALID RECOVERY PROOF\n Host: LIN-66D8BD4EA2C\n Time: 2026-07-02T09:06:32+00:00\n PID: 1371510\n Commit: ebaaf9d2a9\n================================================================\n\n>>> Phase 1: Real Feishu API\n  GET TOKEN: code=0 token=t-g104...P24Q\n  BOT INFO:  code=0                   Send succeeds\n\n>>> Phase 2: 99991663 confirmed\n  BAD TOKEN: code=99991663            Matches FEISHU_TOKEN_INVALID_CODES\n\n>>> Phase 3: Recovery (clear cache -> fresh token)\n  FRESH TOKEN: code=0                 Recovery send succeeds\n\n>>> Phase 4: Production code tests\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/send.retry.test.ts > requestFeishuApi — retry on token-invalid errors (#97287) > exhausts attempts on persistent 99991663 (no recovery) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/send.retry.test.ts > requestFeishuApi — retry on token-invalid errors (#97287) > mixed sequence: rate-limit then token-invalid retries independently 3ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/send.retry.test.ts > requestFeishuApi — retry on token-invalid errors (#97287) > mixed sequence: token-invalid then rate-limit recovers fully 2ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/send.retry.test.ts > requestFeishuApi — retry on token-invalid errors (#97287) > mixed sequence: token-invalid on last attempt still retries once 4ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/send.retry.test.ts > requestFeishuApi — retry on token-invalid errors (#97287) > does not retry on non-token, non-rate-limit errors (unchanged) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > detects 99991663 via getFeishuTokenInvalidCode (production code) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > detects 99991664 via getFeishuTokenInvalidCode (production code) 0ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > does NOT detect non-token errors (230001) 0ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > retries once on 99991663 after clearing all caches (addFeishuTokenCacheClearer) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > retries once on 99991664 after clearing caches 0ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > exhausts attempts on persistent 99991663 (no recovery possible) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > does NOT retry on non-token errors (rate-limit passthrough unchanged) 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > simulates the getter pattern: fresh client after cache clearing 1ms\n ✓ |extension-feishu| extensions/feishu/src/token-retry-proof.test.ts > PR #97295 — full recovery proof > handles fulfilled token-invalid (SDK resolves with {code:99991663} instead of throwing) 0ms\n      Tests  52 passed (52)\n      Tests  52 passed (52)\n```\n\n### Recovery narrative (production code path)\n```\nsend() -> 99991663/99991664\n  -> getFeishuTokenInvalidCode() detects in FEISHU_TOKEN_INVALID_CODES\n  -> clearFeishuTokenCaches() -> addFeishuTokenCacheClearer callbacks\n  -> clearClientCache() expires CTenantAccessToken in plugin-owned sdkCache\n  -> getClient() -> createFeishuClient() -> fresh Client (no stale token)\n  -> retry() with new tenant_access_token -> SUCCESS\n```\n\n### Full test suite (90/90 passed)\n```\ntoken-retry-proof.test.ts   9 passed  (e2e detection + retry + getter)\nsend.retry.test.ts          43 passed (retry logic + mixed sequences)\nsend.test.ts                19 passed (send + reply + card)\nclient.test.ts              19 passed (client cache + SDK isolation)\n```\n\n## AI Assistance\n\n- **AI-assisted**: Yes\n- **Co-Authored-By**: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n- **Human confirmed understanding**: Yes",
